<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden', background: '#0B1120', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 110, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 34, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#FB7185' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>最贵的一页：护栏是独立节点</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 546, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 48 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 340, justifyContent: 'space-between', background: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.06)', border: '1px solid rgba(251,113,133,0.22)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '30px 28px' }}>
            <Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 100, fontWeight: 700, color: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.20)', fontFamily: 'Consolas', lineHeight: 1 }}>04</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    四条机制<br />挡在工具<br />前面
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 3, background: '#FB7185', marginTop: 24 }} />
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.55)', lineHeight: 1.85 }}>
                它们全部写在同一个图节点里，<br />不是散落在各个 handler 的 if。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 716, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20, background: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(251,113,133,0.42)', borderRadius: 10, paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FB7185', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, width: 30 }}>01</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 610 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC' }}>高危工具强制二次确认</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 7 }}>
                        门锁这类设备，没点过确认就不放行——接口层和 Agent 层用的是同一套规则
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.70)', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, width: 30 }}>02</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 610 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC' }}>创建类一律回显确认</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 7 }}>
                        建提醒先把"即将创建：关灯（21:00）"念一遍，你点头才落地
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.70)', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, width: 30 }}>03</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 610 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC' }}>说不清是哪台，就反问</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 7 }}>
                        "打开灯"而家里有两盏，它回"客厅灯、主卧灯都对得上，你指哪一台"——不替你猜
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20, background: '#16223A', border: '1px solid rgba(248,250,252,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(251,113,133,0.70)', fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontWeight: 700, width: 30 }}>04</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 610 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 700, color: '#F8FAFC' }}>跨家庭访问 403，且零副作用</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 7 }}>
                        不是"先执行了再道歉"——在动设备之前就拦下，状态一点不动
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 64, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)' }}>HomeMind · 智能家居多智能体中枢</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.40)', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>08 / 13</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
